<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Biblica® Open Akuapem Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="toc1">Odiyifo Sakaria Nhoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Odiyifo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Sakaria</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nhoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Nkyɛn Ba Ho Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1"/>Ɔsram a ɛto so awotwe wɔ ɔhene Dario adedi afe a ɛto so abien mu no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifo Sakaria a ɔyɛ Berekia babarima na ɔno nso yɛ Ido babarima nkyɛn se:<verse eid="ZEC 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw mo tete agyanom. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3"/>Enti ka kyerɛ nkurɔfo no se: Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Monsan mmra me nkyɛn, na mɛsan aba mo nkyɛn,’ nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4"/>Monnyɛ sɛ mo tete agyanom, a adiyifo a wodii kan no pae mu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, ‘Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Monnan mfi mo akwammɔne ne nneyɛe bɔne ho,’ nanso wɔantie na wɔanyɛ aso amma no. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5"/>Mo tete agyanom wɔ he mprempren? Na adiyifo no, wɔte ase daa ana? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6"/>Na me nsɛm a menam mʼasomfo adiyifo so kae no, amma mo tete agyanom no so ana?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:6">“Afei wonuu wɔn ho na wɔkae se, ‘Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ yɛn nea ɛfata yɛn akwan ne nneyɛe, sɛnea ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa A Ɔwɔ Ohuamnnua No Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7"/>Na da a ɛto so aduonu anan wɔ ɔsram a ɛto so dubaako a wɔfrɛ no Sebat, wɔ ɔhene Dario adedi afe a ɛto so abien so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifo Sakaria a ɔyɛ Ido babarima Berekia babarima no nkyɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8"/>Anadwo no minyaa anisoadehu, mihuu ɔbarima bi a ɔte ɔpɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ so wɔ mʼanim! Na ogyina ohuamnnua bi ntam wɔ obon a mu dɔ mu. Na apɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ, nnodoe ne fitaa wɔ nʼakyi.<verse eid="ZEC 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9"/>Mibisae se, “Eyinom ase ne dɛn, me wura?” Ɔbɔfo a ɔne me rekasa no buae se, “Mɛkyerɛ wo dekode a wɔyɛ.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10"/>Enti ɔbarima a ogyina ohuamnnua ntam no kyerɛɛ ase se, “Wɔyɛ wɔn a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔ wiase afanan nyinaa no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11"/>Na wɔbɛka kyerɛɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo a ogyina ohuamnnua no mu no se, “Yɛakyin afa asase no so nyinaa, na yehuu sɛ wiase nyinaa wɔ ahomegye ne asomdwoe.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo no kae se, “Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, enkosi da bɛn na wubeyi wʼahummɔbɔ afi Yerusalem ne Yuda nkurow a wo bo afuw wɔn mfirihyia aduɔson ni no so?” <verse eid="ZEC 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13"/>Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa akomatɔyamsɛm ne awerɛkyekyesɛm kyerɛɛ ɔbɔfo a ɔne me kasae no.<verse eid="ZEC 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14"/>Afei ɔbɔfo a ɔne me rekasa no kae se, “Pae mu ka saa asɛm yi: Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Metwe Yerusalem ne Sion ho ninkunu yiye, <verse eid="ZEC 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15"/>nanso me bo afuw aman a wɔn aso mu adwo wɔn no. Na anka me bo mfuw wɔn bebree, nanso wɔmaa Israel amanehunu no boroo so.’<verse eid="ZEC 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16"/>“Enti nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: ‘Mɛsan abehu Yerusalem mmɔbɔ, na hɔ na wɔbɛsan asi me fi. Na wɔbɛtwe susuhama mu wɔ Yerusalem so,’ nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17"/>“Kɔ so pae mu ka se, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Nnepa bebu so wɔ me nkurow yi so bio, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkyekye Sion werɛ bio, na wafa Yerusalem.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmɛn Anan Ne Adwumfo Baanan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18"/>Afei, memaa mʼani so, na mihuu mmɛn anan! <verse eid="ZEC 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19"/>Mibisaa ɔbɔfo a ɔne me rekasa no se, “Eyinom yɛ dɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:19">Obuaa me se, “Saa mmɛn yi na ɛbɔɔ Yuda, Israel ne Yerusalem petee no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me adwumfo anan. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21"/>Mibisae se, “Dɛn na eyinom rebɛyɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:21">Obuae se, “Mmɛn anan no bɔɔ Yuda petee a obiara antumi amma ne ti so, nanso adwumfo yi aba sɛ wɔrebehunahuna wɔn, na watutu aman no mmɛn a wɔmemaa so tiaa Yudaman na wɔbɔɔ nnipa no petee no.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Onipa A Okura Susuhama No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1"/>Afei memaa mʼani so, na mihuu ɔbarima bi a okura susuhama sɛ ogyina mʼanim! <verse eid="ZEC 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2"/>Mibisaa no se, “Ɛhe na worekɔ?” Obuae se, “Merekosusuw Yerusalem, ahu ne trɛw ne ne tenten.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3"/>Na ɔbɔfo a na ɔne me rekasa na kɔe, na ɔbɔfo foforo behyiaa no <verse eid="ZEC 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ no se, “Tu mmirika, ka kyerɛ saa aberante no se, ‘Yerusalem bɛyɛ kuropɔn a enni afasu esiane nnipa ne mmoa dodow a wɔwɔ mu nti. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5"/>Na mʼankasa mɛyɛ ogya fasu, atwa ho ahyia,’ sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, ‘na mayɛ ne mu anuonyam.’<verse eid="ZEC 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6"/>“Mommra! Mommra! Munguan mfi atifi asase no so,” sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, “Na mahwete mo mu ama ɔsoro mframa anan no,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7"/>“Mommra, Sion! Munguan, mo a mote Ɔbabea Babilonia!” <verse eid="ZEC 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8"/>Efisɛ sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, “Onuonyamfo no asoma me akotia aman a wɔafow mo nneɛma no akyi no, nea ɔde ne nsa bɛka mo biara no de nsa aka AWURADE aniwa nkesua. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9"/>Nokware, mɛma me nsa so de atia wɔn sɛnea ɛbɛyɛ a wɔn nkoa bɛfom wɔn nneɛma. Na ɛbɛma moahu sɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10"/>“Teɛ mu na ma wʼani nnye, Ɔbabea Sion. Efisɛ, mereba, na mene mo bɛtena,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11"/>“Aman bebree bɛka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho saa da no na wɔabɛyɛ me nkurɔfo. Me ne mo bɛtena, na mubehu sɛ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛfa Yuda sɛ nʼagyapade wɔ asase kronkron no so, na ɔbɛfa Yerusalem bio. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13"/>Monyɛ komm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, adesamma nyinaa, efisɛ wakanyan ne ho wɔ ne tenabea kronkron hɔ.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɔfopanyin Ntade A Ani Tew</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1"/>Afei ɔkyerɛɛ me ɔsɔfopanyin Yosua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yosua: Onipa koro yi ara na wɔbɔ ne din Yesua wɔ Hebri kasa mu wɔ Ɛsra ne Nehemia nhoma mu. Ɛha no, din no gyina hɔ ma nnebɔneyɛfoman Israel (nky. 8-9).</char></note> a ogyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo anim, na Satan gyina ne nifa so rebɛbɔ no sobo. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ Satan se, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nka wʼanim, Satan! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a wafa Yerusalem no, nka wʼanim. Saa ɔbarima yi nyɛ gyentia a wɔatu afi ogya mu ana?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3"/>Na Yosua hyɛ ntadefi, bere a ogyina ɔbɔfo no anim. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4"/>Ɔbɔfo no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn a wogyinagyina nʼanim no se, “Munnyi ne ho ntadefi no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 3:4">Afei ɔka kyerɛɛ Yosua se, “Hwɛ, mayi wo bɔne afi wo so, na mede ntade a ɛyɛ fɛ bɛhyɛ wo.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5"/>Afei mekae se, “Momfa abotiri a ani tew mmɔ ne ti.” Enti wɔde abotiri a ani tew bɔɔ no, na wɔhyɛɛ no atade, bere a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo no gyina hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔfo de saa akwankyerɛ yi maa Yosua: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Sɛ wobɛyɛ osetie ama me na woayɛ mʼapɛde a, ɛno de, wubedi me fi so na woahwɛ mʼabangua so, na mɛma wo baabi atena wɔ nnipa a wogyinagyina ha yi mu.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8"/>“‘Tie, Ɔsɔfopanyin Yosua, wo ne wo nkurɔfo a wɔtete wʼanim yi, moyɛ nnipa a wogyina hɔ ma nneɛma a ɛrebesisi: Mede me somfo, Dubaa no bɛba. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9"/>Hwɛ, ɔbo a mede asi Yosua anim! Ani ason na etuatua saa ɔbo baako no ho, na mikurukyerɛw biribi wɔ so,’ sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, ‘na mede da koro pɛ bɛpepa asase yi so bɔne.<verse eid="ZEC 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10"/>“‘Saa da no mo mu biara bɛto nsa afrɛ ne yɔnko ne no akɔtena ne ngodua ne borɔdɔma dua ase,’ sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Sikakɔkɔɔ Kaneadua Ne Ngonnua Abien No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1"/>Afei ɔbɔfo a ɔne me kasae no san nʼakyi benyan me, sɛnea wonyan obi fi ne nna mu no. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2"/>Obisaa me se, “Dɛn na wuhu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Mibuae se, “Mihu kaneadua a wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ ayɛ a kuruwa si so, na akanea ason a biara wɔ ne dorobɛn sisi so. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3"/>Bio, ngonnua abien sisi ho, baako wɔ kuruwa no nifa so, na baako nso wɔ ne benkum so.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4"/>Mibisaa ɔbɔfo a ɔne me kasae no se, “Eyinom yɛ dɛn, me wura?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5"/>Obuae se, “Wunnim nea eyinom yɛ ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:5">Mekae se, “Dabi, me wura.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6"/>Enti ɔka kyerɛɛ me se, “Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔde rekɔma Serubabel: ‘Ɛnyɛ tumi so, na ɛnyɛ ahoɔden so, na mmom, ɛnam me Honhom so,’ sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7"/>“Woyɛ dɛn, bepɔw kɛse ana? Serubabel anim no wobɛyɛ asase tamaa. Afei ɔde abo afɛɛfɛ no bɛba abehyia osebɔ se, ‘Onyankopɔn nhyira so! Onyankopɔn nhyira so!’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9"/>“Serubabel nsa na ato asɔredan yi fapem, ne nsa nso na ebewie. Na mubehu sɛ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10"/>“Hena na obu nneɛma nketenkete mfiaseda animtiaa? Sɛ nnipa hu sɛ Serubabel kura kirebennyɛ susudua no a, wɔn ani begye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:10">“(Saa ani ason yi yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani a ɛhwɛ wiase mmaa nyinaa.)”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11"/>Na mibisaa ɔbɔfo no se, “Saa ngonnua abien no a esisi kaneadua no nifa ne benkum no yɛ dɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12"/>Na mibisaa no bio se, “Ngodua mman abien a ehwie ngo a ani yɛ akokɔsrade fa sikakɔkɔɔ dorobɛn abien no mu no yɛ dɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13"/>Obuae se, “Enti wunnim nea eyinom yɛ ana?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:13">Mibuae se, “Dabi, me wura.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14"/>Nti ɔkae se, “Eyinom ne baanu a wɔasra wɔn ngo sɛ wɔnsom Awurade a odi wiase nyinaa so no.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhoma Mmobɔwee A Etu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1"/>Mehwɛɛ bio, na mihuu nhoma mmobɔwee a ɛretu wɔ wim wɔ mʼanim! <verse eid="ZEC 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2"/>Obisaa me se, “Dɛn na wuhu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:2">Mibuae se, “Mihu nhoma mmobɔwee a ɛnenam wim a ne tenten yɛ anammɔn aduasa, na ne trɛw nso yɛ anammɔn dunum.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ me se, “Eyi ne nnome a ɛreba asase yi so nyinaa; sɛnea ɔfa baako kyerɛ no, wɔbɛpam ɔkorɔmfo biara, na ɔfa baako nso kyerɛ sɛ, obiara a ɔka ntamhunu no, wɔbɛpam no. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> pae mu ka se, ‘Meresoma nnome yi na ɛbɛhyɛn ɔkorɔmfo ne obiara a ɔde me din ka ntamhunu no fi. Ɛbɛka ofie hɔ na asɛe ne nnua ne abo.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbea A Ɔte Kɛntɛn Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5"/>Afei ɔbɔfo a na ɔne me rekasa no baa nʼanim bɛka kyerɛɛ me se, “Ma wʼani so na hwɛ eyi, nea ɛreba yi.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6"/>Mibisa sɛ “Ɛyɛ dɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 5:6">Obuae se, “Ɛyɛ kɛntɛn a wɔde susuw nneɛma.” Ɔtoaa so se, “nnipa a wɔwɔ wiase yi mu bɔne ahyɛ no ma.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7"/>Afei woyii kɛntɛn no so sumpii mmuaso no, na mu na na ɔbea bi hyɛ! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8"/>Ɔkae se, “Eyi yɛ atirimɔdensɛm,” afei ɔkaa ɔbea no hyɛɛ kɛntɛn no mu na ɔde sumpii mmuaso no kataa no so.<verse eid="ZEC 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9"/>Afei memaa me ti so huu mmea baanu a wɔwɔ ntaban te sɛ asukɔnkɔn de a wɔde dannan wɔn ho wɔ wim. Wɔmaa kɛntɛn no so kɔɔ wim, ɔsoro ne asase ntam.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10"/>Mibisaa ɔbɔfo a na ɔne me rekasa no se, “Ɛhe na wɔde kɛntɛn no rekɔ?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11"/>Obuae se, “Wɔde rekɔ Babilonia asase so akosi fi ama no. Na sɛ, wowie a, wɔde kɛntɛn no bɛkɔ akosi nʼafa.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nteaseɛnam Anan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1"/>Memaa mʼani so bio, na mihuu nteaseɛnam anan a efi mmepɔw abien ntam reba, mmepɔw no yɛ kɔbere mfrafrae. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2"/>Teaseɛnam a edi kan no, na apɔnkɔ kɔkɔɔ na wɔtwe, na apɔnkɔ tuntum nso twe nea ɛto so abien no. <verse eid="ZEC 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3"/>Nea ɛto so abiɛsa no, na apɔnkɔ fitaa na wɔtwe. Nea ɛto so anan no, na apɔnkɔ ntokontrama na wɔtwe, na apɔnkɔ no nyinaa ho yɛ den. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4"/>Mibisaa ɔbɔfo a na ɔne me rekasa no se, “Me wura, eyinom yɛ dɛn?”<verse eid="ZEC 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5"/>Ɔbɔfo no buaa me se, “Eyinom yɛ ahonhom anan a wofi ɔsoro, na wɔrefi wiase nyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no anim akɔ. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6"/>Teaseɛnam a apɔnkɔ tuntum retwe no rekɔ ɔman a ɛwɔ atifi fam no so. Teaseɛnam a apɔnkɔ fitaa retwe no rekɔ atɔe fam; na nea apɔnkɔ ntokontrama twe no rekɔ anafo fam.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7"/>Apɔnkɔ ahoɔdenfo no fii adi no, wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔkɔ asase nyinaa so. Na ɔbɔfo no kae se, “Monkɔ asase nyinaa so!” Enti wɔkɔɔ asase so mmaa nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8"/>Afei ɔfrɛɛ me se, “Hwɛ, wɔn a wɔrekɔ atifi fam man so no ama me Honhom ahomegye wɔ atifi fam asase no so.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosua Ahenkyɛw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn. Ɔkae se, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10"/>“Gye sikakɔkɔɔ ne dwetɛ fi wɔn a wɔatwa wɔn asu, Heldai, Tobia ne Yedaia a wofi Babilonia aba no nkyɛn. Da no ara kɔ Sefania babarima Yosia fi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11"/>Gye dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ na fa yɛ ahenkyɛw, hyɛ ɔsɔfopanyin Yosua a ɔyɛ Yehosadak babarima no ti. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12"/>Ka kyerɛ no se, sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: ‘Ɔbarima a wɔfrɛ no Dubaa no ni, na ɔbɛfefɛw afi hɔ akosi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13"/>Ɔno na obesi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no, na wɔbɛhyɛ no anuonyam, na ɔbɛtena nʼahengua so adi ne hene, na ɔbɛyɛ ɔsɔfo wɔ nʼahengua so. Afei asomdwoe bɛba abien no ntam.’ <verse eid="ZEC 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14"/>Wɔde ahenkyɛw no bɛma Heldai, Tobia, Yedaia ne Sefania babarima Hen, na wɔde ayɛ nkae ade wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15"/>Wɔn a wɔwɔ akyirikyiri no bɛba abɛboa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no si, na mubehu sɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me mo nkyɛn. Sɛ moyɛ osetie ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Nyankopɔn nokware mu a, eyi bɛba mu.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atɛntrenee Ne Ahummɔbɔ Na Ɛnyɛ Mmuadadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1"/>Ɔhene Dario adedi mfe anan so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Sakaria nkyɛn ɔsram a ɛto so akron a wɔfrɛ no Kislev no da ɛto so anan no mu. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2"/>Na Bet-Elfo asoma Sareser ne Regem-Melek ne wɔn mmarima sɛ wɔnkɔsrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="ZEC 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3"/>Wɔmfa asɔfo a wɔwɔ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi ne adiyifo so mmisa se, “Menkɔ so ntwa adwo, nni mmuada wɔ ɔsram a ɛto so anum no mu, sɛnea mayɛ no mfe bebree a atwa mu no ana?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4"/>Afei Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn se, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5"/>“Bisa asase no so nnipa nyinaa ne asɔfo no se, ‘Mfe aduɔson a atwam no, sɛ mudii mmuada na mutwaa adwo wɔ asram anum ne ason so no, na ɛyɛ ampa sɛ me nti na mudi mmuada no ana? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6"/>Bere a mudidi na monom no, na ɛnyɛ mo ara na moyɛ de gye mo ani ana? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7"/>Ɛnyɛ saa nsɛm yi ara na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> faa kan adiyifo so paee mu kae, wɔ bere a Yerusalem ne nkurow a atwa ne ho ahyia no wɔ asomdwoe ne nkɔso no, bere a na nnipa akɔtena Negeb ne atɔe fam nkoko no so ana?’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Sakaria nkyɛn bio: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9"/>“Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se, ‘Mummu atɛn a ɛyɛ nokware na munnya ahummɔbɔ ne ayamhyehye mma mo ho mo ho. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10"/>Monnhyɛ akunafo, ayisaa, ahɔho ne ahiafo so. Monnnwene bɔne mo koma mu mma mo ho mo ho.’<verse eid="ZEC 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11"/>“Nanso wɔantie; wɔde asoɔden dan wɔn akyi na wosisiw wɔn aso. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12"/>Wɔyɛɛ wɔn koma den sɛ ɔtwɛrebo, na wɔantie mmara anaa nsɛm a Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam ne Honhom so de somaa kan adiyifo no. Ɛno nti, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bo fuw yiye.<verse eid="ZEC 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13"/>“ ‘Mefrɛe no, wɔannye me so, enti wɔfrɛ a merennye wɔn so,’ sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14"/>‘Mede mfɛtɛ bɔɔ wɔn petee aman nyinaa so ma wɔkɔyɛɛ ahɔho wɔ hɔ. Asase a wogyaw no daa mpan a obiara ntwa mu wɔ hɔ. Sɛɛ na wɔyɛ maa asase fɛfɛɛfɛ no sɛee.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Hyɛ Bɔ Sɛ Obehyira Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio. <verse eid="ZEC 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2"/>Sɛɛ na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: “Metwe Sion ho ninkunu pa ara; metwe ne ho ninkunu anibere so.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3"/>Nea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, “Mɛsan akɔ Sion na makɔtena Yerusalem. Afei wɔbɛfrɛ Yerusalem Nokware Kuropɔn, na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bepɔw no, wɔbɛfrɛ no Bepɔw Kronkron.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Nkwakoraa ne mmerewa bɛtenatena Yerusalem mmɔnten so bio a obiara kura pema, esiane onyin nti. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5"/>Na mmarimaa ne mmeawa a wɔredi agoru bɛhyɛ kuropɔn no mmɔnten so ma.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Nkae no de, ɛbɛyɛ wɔn nwonwa saa bere no, na me nso ɛbɛyɛ me nwonwa ana?”<verse eid="ZEC 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Megye me nkurɔfo afi aman a ɛwɔ apuei ne atɔe no so. <verse eid="ZEC 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8"/>Mede wɔn bɛsan aba abɛtena Yerusalem; wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfo, na mayɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn wɔ nokware ne trenee mu.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Mo a afei na morete nsɛm a adiyifo no kae no; adiyifo a na wɔwɔ hɔ bere a wɔtoo Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi fapem no, monhyɛ mo ho den, na moatumi asi asɔredan no. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10"/>Bere no nnya nsoe no, na wontua apaade mma nnipa anaa mmoa. Atamfo nti, na obiara ntumi nkɔ nʼadwuma so asomdwoe mu, efisɛ na mede mpaapaemu aba wɔn mu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11"/>Nanso afei de, merenyɛ nkae yi sɛnea meyɛɛ kan no,” sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12"/>“Aba no benyin yiye, bobe bɛsow nʼaba, asase no bɛbɔ nʼaduan na ɔsoro nso bɛtɔ ne bosu. Mede saa nneɛma yi nyinaa bɛma nkae yi sɛ wɔn agyapade. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13"/>Mo, Yuda ne Israel, moayɛ nnome wɔ aman no mu, nanso megye mo na moayɛ nhyira. Munnsuro, na monhyɛ mo ho den.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Sɛnea meyɛɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede atoyerɛnkyɛm bɛba mo so, na mannya ahummɔbɔ bere a mo agyanom fuw me bo no, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15"/>saa ara na afei mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ mɛyɛ Yerusalem ne Yuda yiye. Munnsuro. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16"/>Nea ɛsɛ sɛ moyɛ ni: Munni mo ho mo ho nokware. Mummu atɛntrenee wɔ mo asennii; <verse eid="ZEC 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17"/>mommmɔ pɔw bɔne ntia mo ho mo ho, na monnnɔ ntam hunu. Mikyi saa nneɛma yi nyinaa,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio. <verse eid="ZEC 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Asram anan, anum, ason ne du mu mmuadadi no bɛyɛ anigye ne ahosɛpɛwmmere, na ɛbɛyɛ anigye afahyɛ ama Yuda. Enti monnɔ nokware ne asomdwoe.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni, “Nnipa bebree ne wɔn a wɔtete nkuropɔn bebree so bɛba ara, <verse eid="ZEC 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21"/>na nnipa a wofi kuropɔn baako so bɛkɔ foforo so akɔka se, ‘Momma yɛnkɔ mprempren ara nkɔsrɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na yɛnhwehwɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Me de, merekɔ.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22"/>Na nnipa bebree ne aman akɛse bɛba Yerusalem abɛhwehwɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, na wɔakotow asrɛ no.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23"/>Nea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni: “Nna no mu, nnipa du a wɔka kasa ahorow na wofi aman ahorow so bɛba abeso Yudani atade mmuano mu, na wɔbɛka se, ‘Wo ne yɛn nkɔ, efisɛ yɛate sɛ Onyankopɔn ka wo ho.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Atemmu A Etia Israel Atamfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1"/>Nkɔmhyɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 9:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm tia Hadrak asase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">na ɛbɛka Damasko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">efisɛ, nnipa ne Israel mmusuakuw nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">ani wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2"/>Na ɛbɛka Hamat a ɔne no bɔ hye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">ɛbɛka Tiro ne Sidon, ɛwɔ mu sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3"/>Tiro asi abandennen ama ne ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">waboa dwetɛ ano te sɛ mfutuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">ne sikakɔkɔɔ ano te sɛ dɔte a ɛwɔ mmɔnten so.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4"/>Nanso Awurade begye nʼahode nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">na wasɛe ne tumi a ɔwɔ wɔ po so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">na wɔde ogya bɛhyew no dwerɛbee.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5"/>Askelon behu na wasuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa de ɔyaw bebubu ne mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">na Ekron nso saa ara, efisɛ nʼanidaso bɛsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gasa bɛhwere ne hene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">na wobegyaw Askelon ofituw.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Askelon…Gasa…Ekron: Filistifo nkuropɔn abiɛsa. Nʼanidaso bɛsa: Esiane sɛ Ekron da Filistiman atifi pɛɛ nti, ɛno na ebedi kan ahu amane. Nʼanidaso sɛ Tiro begyina mu ama no ɔhaw anaa abɛbrɛsɛ bi mu no renkosi hwee so.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6"/>Ananafo bɛtena Asdod,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">na metwa Filistifo ahantan agu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7"/>Meyi mogya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mogya—Egyina hɔ ma abosom afɔrebɔ. Akyiwade nnuan—Nnapɔnna nnuan a ho ntew. Yebusifo—Nnipa bi a wɔtenaa Yerusalem tete bere mu a wɔbɛfraa Yudafo mu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 24:16-24">2 Sam 24.16-24</ref></char>).</char></note> afi wɔn ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">akyiwade nnuan nso meyi afi wɔn ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Nkae no bɛyɛ yɛn Nyankopɔn de;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">wɔbɛyɛ Yuda ntuanofo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">na Ekron bɛyɛ sɛ Yebusifo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8"/>Nanso mɛbɔ me Fi ho ban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">wɔ wɔn a wɔtetɛw bɔ korɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ɔhyɛsoni biara ntumi mfa me nkurɔfo so bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">efisɛ afei merewɛn.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sion Hene Ba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9"/>Di ahurusi, Ɔbabea Sion!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Teɛ mu, Ɔbabea Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Hwɛ, wo hene reba wo nkyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ɔteɛ na ɔwɔ nkwagye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">odwo, na ɔte afurum so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">afurum ba so na ɔte.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10"/>Megye nteaseɛnam afi Efraim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">ne akofo apɔnkɔ afi Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">na akodi tadua no wobebubu mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Ɔbɛpae mu aka asomdwoe nsɛm akyerɛ aman no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Nʼahenni befi po akɔka po;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">ebefi Asubɔnten no akɔpem nsase ano.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11"/>Na wo de, esiane me ne wo mogya apam no nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">meyi wo nneduafo afi amoa a nsu nni mu mu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12"/>Monsan nkɔ mʼaban mu, nneduafo a mowɔ anidaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">mprempren mpo merebɔ mo nkae sɛ mɛhyɛ mo anan mu mmɔho.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13"/>Mɛkom Yuda sɛnea mikuntun me tadua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">na mede Efraim bɛhyɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Mɛkanyan wo mmabarima, Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">atia wo Hela mmabarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">na mɛyɛ wo sɛ ɔkofo afoa.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14"/>Afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛda ne ho adi wɔ wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">nʼagyan betwa yerɛw te sɛ anyinam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Otumfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhyɛn torobɛnto no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">ɔbɛbɔ nsra wɔ atɔe fam ahum mu,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkata wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">Wɔde ahwimmo bɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">na wɔde adi nkonim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Wɔbɛnom na wɔabobɔ mu sɛnea wɔanom nsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wɔbɛyɛ ma te sɛ kuruwa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">wɔde pete afɔremuka ntwea so.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Nyankopɔn, begye wɔn saa da no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">sɛ oguanhwɛfo gye ne nguan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Wobetwa yerɛw yerɛw wɔ nʼasase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">sɛ abohemaa a ɛbobɔ ahenkyɛw ho.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17"/>Sɛnea wɔn ho betwa na wɔn ho ayɛ fɛ afa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Aduan bɛma mmerante anyin ahoɔden so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">na nsa foforo bɛma mmabaa anyin saa ara.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Bɛhwɛ Yudafo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1"/>Mummisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ nsu asusowbere mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔyɛ osu ne mu ahum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Ɔma osu tɔ ma nnipa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">ne nnɔbae nso ma obiara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2"/>Ahoni no ka nnaadaasɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">nkɔmhyɛfo nya anisoadehu a ɛyɛ atoro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">wɔde nkontomposɛm kyerɛ dae ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">wɔma awerɛkyekye kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Enti nnipa no nenam te sɛ nguan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">a wonni ɔhwɛfo na wɔhyɛ wɔn so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3"/>“Me bo afuw nguanhwɛfo no yiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">na mɛtwe ntuanofo no aso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">ne nguankuw a wɔyɛ Yudafi no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">na wayɛ wɔn sɛ anuonyam pɔnkɔ wɔ ɔsa mu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4"/>Tweatibo befi Yuda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">na ntamadan pɛe befi ne mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">ɔsa mu tadua befi Yuda mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">na sodifo nyinaa nso saa ara.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5"/>Wɔbɛbɔ mu ayɛ sɛ dɔmmarima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">a wotiatia mmorɔn so dontori mu wɔ ɔko mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Esiane sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka wɔn ho no nti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">wɔbɛko na wɔadi apɔnkɔsotefo no so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6"/>“Mɛhyɛ Yudafi den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">na magye Yosefi no nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Mede wɔn besi wɔn dedaw mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">efisɛ me yam hyehye me wɔ wɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Wɔbɛyɛ te sɛ nea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">mempoo wɔn mpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">na mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Nyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">na megye wɔn so.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7"/>Efraimfo bɛyɛ sɛ dɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">wɔn ani begye te sɛ nea wɔanom nsa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Wɔn mma behu na wɔn ani begye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">wobedi ahurusi wɔ wɔn koma mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8"/>Mɛto nsa afrɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">aboaboa wɔn ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Ampa ara megye wɔn bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">wɔbɛdɔɔso sɛ kan no.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9"/>Ɛwɔ mu, mɛhwete wɔn mu akɔ aman so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">nanso wɔbɛkae me wɔ akyirikyiri nsase so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Wɔne wɔn mma bɛtena nkwa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">na wɔbɛsan aba.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10"/>Mede wɔn befi Misraim aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">mɛboa wɔn ano afi Asiria.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Mede wɔn bɛba Gilead ne Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">na wɔrensen hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11"/>Wɔbɛfa ɔhaw ne abɛbrɛsɛ po mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">nanso wobedi po asorɔkye a ehuru no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Nil mu nsu nyinaa bɛyow.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">Asiria ahomaso nso wɔbɛbrɛ no ase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">na Misraim ahempema betwa mu akɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12"/>Mɛhyɛ wɔn den wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">na ne din mu na wɔbɛnantew,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1"/>Buebue wʼapon, Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">na ogya mmɛhyew wo sida!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2"/>Twa adwo, wo ɔpepaw, na sida ahwe ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">wɔasɛe nnua a ɛwɔ anuonyam no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Twa adwo Basan adum;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">wɔabubu kwaeberentuw no mu nnua no!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3"/>Tie nguanhwɛfo agyaadwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">wɔasɛe wɔn adidibea frɔmfrɔm no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Tie gyata no mmubomu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">Yordan ho nkyɛkyerɛ fɛɛfɛ no asɛe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nguanhwɛfo Baanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4"/>Sɛɛ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> me Nyankopɔn se: “Fa nguankuw a wɔrebekum wɔn no kɔ adidibea. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5"/>Atɔfo no kunkum nguan no na wɔntwe wɔn aso. Wɔn a wɔtɔn nguan no ka se, ‘Monkamfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mayɛ ɔdefo!’ Na nguan no ahwɛfo no mpo nnya ahummɔbɔ mma wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6"/>Merenhu asase no so nnipa mmɔbɔ bio,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. “Mede obiara bɛhyɛ ne yɔnko ne hene nsa. Wɔbɛhyɛ asase no so, na merennye obiara mfi wɔn nsam.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7"/>Enti mede nguankuw a wɔrekokum wɔn no kɔɔ adidibea, ne titiriw ne wɔn a wɔayɛ mmɔbɔ no. Afei mefaa pema abien, na mefrɛɛ baako Adɔe na baako nso Nkabom na mede wɔn kɔɔ adidi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8"/>Ɔsram baako mu, mepam nguanhwɛfo abiɛsa no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 11:8">Nguankuw no ampɛ me, na wɔmaa me brɛe <verse eid="ZEC 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9"/>na mekae se, “Merenyɛ mo hwɛfo bio. Wɔn a wɔrewu nwu, na wɔn a wɔreyera nso nyera. Na ma wɔn a aka no nso nkyekyere wɔn ho wɔn ho nwe.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10"/>Afei mefaa me pema a mefrɛ no Adɔe no bubuu mu de sɛee apam a me ne aman no nyinaa ayɛ no. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11"/>Wɔsɛee no da no ara, na wɔn a wɔrehu amane wɔ nguankuw no mu a na wɔrehwɛ me no hui se, ɛyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm.<verse eid="ZEC 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ wɔn se, “Sɛ ɛbɛyɛ yiye a muntua me ka, na sɛ ɛnte saa nso a, momma ɛntena hɔ.” Enti, wotuaa dwetɛ mpɔw aduasa maa me.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tua me ka—Ɛkyerɛ ntetewmu. Ma ɛntena hɔ—Esi ntetewmu so dua. Dwetɛ mpɔw aduasa—Tete hɔ no, saa na na Israelfo tɔ nkoa.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Tow ma ɔnwemfo no,” ɛbo a ɛsɔ ani a wɔatwa ama me no. Enti, mefaa dwetɛ mpɔw aduasa no, na metow maa ɔnwemfo a ɔwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi mu no.<verse eid="ZEC 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14"/>Afei mibuu me pema a ɛto so abien a wɔfrɛ no Nkabom no mu, de sɛee onuayɛ a ɛda Yuda ne Israel ntam no.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me se, “Fa oguanhwɛfo kwasea no nneɛma no bio. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16"/>Na merebɛma oguanhwɛfo bi asɔre asase no so a ɔrenhwehwɛ nea wayera, ɔrenhwehwɛ nguantenmma no akyi kwan, ɔrensa nea wapira yare, ɔremma nea ɔwɔ ahoɔden aduan, na mmom, ɔbɛwe nguan a wɔadɔ no nam, na watwitwa wɔn tɔte.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17"/>“Nnome nka oguanhwɛfo a ne so nni mfaso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">na oguan gya nguankuw no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Afoa ntwa ne basa, ne nʼaniwa nifa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">Ne basa no nwu koraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">nʼaniwa nifa no mfura koraa!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɛsɛe Yerusalem Atamfo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1"/>Nkɔmhyɛ: Eyi ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛfa Israel ho.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ZEC 12:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 12:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔtrɛw ɔsoro mu, nea ɔto asase fapem, nea ɔyɛ honhom a ɔte onipa mu asɛm ni: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2"/>“Merebɛyɛ Yerusalem kuruwa a ɛbɛma aman a atwa ne ho ahyia no atɔ ntintan. Wɔbɛtow ahyɛ Yuda ne Yerusalem so. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3"/>Saa da no a wiase aman nyinaa aboa wɔn ho ano retia no no, mɛma Yerusalem ayɛ ɔbotantim ama aman no nyinaa. Wɔn a wɔbɛpɛ sɛ wopirew no no nyinaa bepirapira wɔn ho. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4"/>Saa da no, mɛma ɔpɔnkɔ biara abɔ huboa, na mɛma ne sotefo nso abɔ dam,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. “Mebue mʼani ahwɛ Yudafi, na mefurafura aman ahorow no apɔnkɔ ani. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5"/>Na Yuda mmusua bɛka wɔ wɔn koma mu se, ‘Yerusalemfo yɛ ahoɔdenfo, efisɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ wɔn Nyankopɔn.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6"/>“Saa da no, mɛyɛ Yuda mmusua sɛ ogya asanka a ɛhyɛ nnyina mu, te sɛ ogyatɛn a ɛredɛw wɔ nwura a wɔaboa ano mu. Wɔbɛhyew nnipa a wɔatwa wɔn ho ahyia nyinaa wɔ benkum ne nifa, nanso hwee renka Yerusalem wɔ faako a ɔwɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7"/>“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ Yuda atenae ho ban kan, sɛnea Dawidfi ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem anuonyam renkyɛn Yudafo anuonyam. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8"/>Saa da no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem ho ban, nea ɔyɛ mmerɛw koraa wɔ wɔn mu no bɛyɛ sɛ Dawid. Na Dawid asefo bɛyɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn, te sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Bɔfo a odi wɔn anim. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9"/>Saa da no, mefi ase asɛe aman a wɔko tia Yerusalem nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wotwa Adwo Ma Nea Wohwirew No No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10"/>“Mehwie adom ne nkotosrɛ honhom agu Dawidfi ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem so. Wɔbɛhwɛ me a wɔahwirew me, na wɔatwa adwo ama no te sɛ obi a ɔretwa adwo wɔ ɔba koro ho, na wɔasu yayaayaw te sɛ obi a ɔresu ne ba barima piesie. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11"/>Saa da no agyaadwotwa a ɛwɔ Yerusalem no ano bɛyɛ den te sɛ Hadad-Rimon agyaadwotwa wɔ Megido asasetam so. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12"/>Asase no sofo nyinaa bedi awerɛhow, abusua biara ne wɔn yerenom; Dawid abusua ne wɔn yerenom, Natan abusua ne wɔn yerenom, <verse eid="ZEC 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13"/>Lewi abusua ne wɔn yerenom, Simei abusua ne wɔn yerenom, <verse eid="ZEC 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14"/>ne mmusua a aka no nyinaa ne wɔn yerenom.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne Ho Ahodwira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1"/>“Saa da no, wobetu asubura ama Dawidfi ne Yerusalemfo de ahohoro wɔn bɔne ne wɔn ho fi.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2"/>“Saa da no, meyi ahoni no din afi asase no so, na wɔrenkae wɔn bio,” sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni. “Meyi adiyifo ne fi honhom afi asase no so. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3"/>Sɛ obi kɔ so hyɛ nkɔm a agya ne ɛna a wɔwoo saa nipa no bɛka akyerɛ no se, ‘Ɛsɛ sɛ wuwu, efisɛ, wode <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din atwa atoro.’ Sɛ ɔhyɛ nkɔm a, ɔno ankasa awofo bɛwɔ no afoa.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4"/>“Saa da no, odiyifo biara ani bewu wɔ ne nkɔmhyɛ anisoadehu ho. Ɔrenhyɛ odiyifo atade a wɔde nwi ayɛ no mfa nnaadaa nnipa. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5"/>Ɔbɛka se, ‘Menyɛ odiyifo. Meyɛ okuafo. Na efi me mmerantebere mu, asase yi so na minya mʼano aduan.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6"/>Na sɛ obi bisa no se, ‘Akuru bɛn na ɛwɔ wo ho yi a?’ Obebua se, ‘Ɛyɛ akuru a minyaa wɔ me nnamfonom fi.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Oguanhwɛfo No, Na Nguan No Hwete</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7"/>“Sɔre, afoa, sɔre tia me guanhwɛfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">tia onipa a ɔbɛn me!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">Sɛnea Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">“Bɔ oguanhwɛfo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">na nguan no bɛbɔ ahwete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">na mɛma me nsa so atia nguantenmma no.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8"/>Asase no so nyinaa,” sɛnea <char style="nd">Awurade</char> se ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">“Wɔbɛbɔ nkyɛmu abiɛsa mu abien ahwe fam ma wɔawuwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">na nkyɛmu abiɛsa mu baako bɛka wɔ so.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9"/>Mede nkyɛmu abiɛsa mu baako yi bɛfa ogya mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">mɛnan wɔn te sɛnea wɔnan dwetɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na masɔn wɔn so sɛ sikakɔkɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Wɔbɛbɔ me din afrɛ me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na megye wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mɛka se, ‘Wɔyɛ me nkurɔfo,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">na wɔbɛka se, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ yɛn Nyankopɔn.’ ”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Bɛba Abedi Hene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> da bi reba a, wɔbɛkyɛ mo asade wɔ mo mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2"/>Mɛboaboa aman no nyinaa ano abɛko atia Yerusalem; wɔbɛko afa kuropɔn no, wobewia afi mu nneɛma, na wɔato mmea no mmonnaa. Wɔbɛfa kuropɔn no mu nnipa no mu fa akɔ nnommum mu, nanso nkae no bɛka kuropɔn no mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛkɔ akɔko atia saa aman no, sɛnea ɔko, ɔkoda no. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4"/>Saa da no, ɔde nʼanammɔn besisi Ngo Bepɔw a ɛwɔ Yerusalem apuei fam no so, na Ngo Bepɔw no mu bɛpae abien afi apuei fam akosi atɔe fam na ayɛ obon kɛse. Ɛbɛma bepɔw no fa akɔ atifi fam, na fa nso akɔ anafo fam. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5"/>Mubeguan afa me bon no mu, efisɛ ekosi Asel.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asal—Ɛyɛ kurow bi a ɛda Yerusalem apuei fam a ɛno na ɛkyerɛ faako a obon foforo no ano si.</char></note> Mubeguan, sɛnea moyɛɛ no bere a asase wosow wɔ Yudahene Usia bere so no. Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Nyankopɔn, bɛba a ahotefo nyinaa ka ne ho.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6"/>Saa da no, hann, awɔw ne sukyerɛmma remma. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7"/>Ɛbɛyɛ da sononko a enni awia anaa anadwo, da a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na onim. Onwini bedwo no na hann wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8"/>Saa da no, nkwa nsu bɛteɛ afi Yerusalem, fa bɛkɔ apuei po<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛno ne Nkyene Po</char></note> mu, na fa akɔ atɔe po<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ɛno ne Ntam Po</char></note> mu, ahohurubere ne awɔwbere mu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bedi hene wɔ asase nyinaa so. Saa da no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ baako na ne din nso ayɛ baako pɛ.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10"/>Asase a efi Geba kosi Rimon a ɛda Yerusalem anafo fam nyinaa bɛyɛ sɛ Araba. Nanso wɔbɛma Yerusalem so; efi Benyamin Pon kosi Ɔpon A Edi Kan de kɔ Ntwea so Pon, afei efi Hananel Abantenten kosi adehye nsakyiamoa nyinaa, na ɛbɛtena ne sibea. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11"/>Nnipa bɛtena mu, na wɔrensɛe no bio. Yerusalem benya asomdwoe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12"/>Eyi ne ɔyaredɔm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de bɛbɔ aman a wɔko tiaa Yerusalem no. Wɔn honam bɛporɔw bere a wogyina wɔn anan so, Wɔn aniwa nkesua bɛporɔw wɔ wɔn ntokuru mu, na wɔn tɛkrɛma bɛporɔw wɔ wɔn anom. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13"/>Saa da no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nnipa abɔ huboa, na wobetwa wɔn ho ako. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14"/>Yuda nso bɛko wɔ Yerusalem. Wɔbɛfa aman a atwa ahyia hɔ no nyinaa ahonyade a ɛyɛ sikakɔkɔɔ, dwetɛ ne adurade bebree. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15"/>Saa ɔyaredɔm koro yi ara bɛka apɔnkɔ, mfurumpɔnkɔ, yoma, mfurum ne mmoa a aka a wɔwɔ atamfo nsra mu nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16"/>Afei wɔn a wɔbɛka wɔ aman a wɔko tiaa Yerusalem no nyinaa bɛkɔ akɔsom Ɔhene no, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no afe biara, na wɔadi Asese Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17"/>Sɛ wiase mu nnipa bi ankɔ Yerusalem ankɔsom Ɔhene no, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no a, osu rentɔ mma wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18"/>Sɛ Misraimfo ankɔ hɔ ankɔhyɛ fa no bi a, osu rentɔ mma wɔn. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ɔyaredɔm a ɔma ɛba aman a wɔnnkɔ Asese Afahyɛ no so no bɛbɔ wɔn. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19"/>Eyi bɛyɛ asotwe ama Misraim ne aman a wɔnnkɔ Asese Afahyɛ no nyinaa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20"/>Saa da no, wobekurukyerɛw asɛm a ɛka se: KRONKRON MA <char style="nd">Awurade</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">KRONKRON MA <char style="nd">Awurade</char>: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eyi yɛ nsɛm a wɔatwa agu sikakɔkɔɔ apampaa so de abɔ ɔsɔfopanyin no abotiri anim (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:36-38">2 Mose 28.36-38</ref></char>) a ɛde kae no sɛ wɔayɛ no kronkron ama Awurade adwumayɛ.</char></note> wɔ nnɔnnɔmma a ɛsensɛn apɔnkɔ kɔn mu ho, na nkuku a wɔde noa aduan wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi no bɛyɛ sɛ nkuruwa kronkron a esisi afɔremuka anim. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21"/>Kuku biara a ɛwɔ Yerusalem ne Yuda bɛyɛ nea wɔatew ho ama Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na wɔn a wɔba bɛbɔ afɔre nyinaa bɛfa nkuku yi bi anoa mu. Na saa da no, wɔrenhu Kanaanni wɔ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> fi bio.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14"/>
</usx>
